OL,3,GNEWSA'Seeing fires destroying homes was
OL,4,Alike history repeating itself'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the prime minister visited
OL,7,FStourbridge two weeks ago after the
OL,8,Fdevastating wildfires destroyed 19
OL,9,Fhomes and damaged 18 others, he
OL,10,Fdeclared: "I've never seen scenes like
OL,11,Fthis in Britain."
OL,13,FBut in July 2022, in an almost
OL,14,Fidentical set of circumstances to those
OL,15,Fin the West Midlands town, a blaze tore
OL,16,Fthrough 18 homes in the village of
OL,17,FWennington, in East London, during
OL,18,Frecord-breaking temperatures.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
