OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Seeing fires destroying homes was
OL,4,Alike history repeating itself'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in response to Andy Burnham's
OL,7,Fstatement, Carole Hager, who lost her
OL,8,Fhome of 58 years and all her belongings
OL,9,Fin that fire, said: "We feel
OL,10,Fforgotten."
OL,12,FThe 82-year-old believes the government
OL,13,Fmissed opportunities to act four years
OL,14,Fago to protect communities from the
OL,15,Fincreasing threat of wildfires in an
OL,16,Fera of climate change.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
